(S, "In which year was the Durand Line between Pakistan (then British India) and Afghanistan agreed?", ["1893", "1857", "1905", "1919"], 0, "The Durand Line agreement was signed in 1893 between Afghan Amir Abdur Rahman Khan and the British envoy Sir Mortimer Durand.", "The Durand Line is the border that Pakistan inherited in 1947, and Afghanistan has long disputed it.", [2346, 3660, 474, 696, 273]),
